<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,401 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,401 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged down to 5,401 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,399 on Tuesday. Dealers said the central bank sold $2.05 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Sept 25		 Sept 24</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,401		   5,399</p>
<p> Volume traded (mln $)	4.59		    6.63</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
